{"id": "22-1146-2-2", "zh": "以 i 结尾的阳性词类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1147-2-10", "zh": "依“gasīnaṃ”规则，（si）脱落：muni gacchati（牟尼走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1148-2-19", "zh": "165. 脱落（lopo）[ka.118; rū.146; nī.293]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1149-2-8", "zh": "在 jha、la 之后，yo 词尾脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1149-9-15", "zh": "依“yolopanīsu dīgho”规则变为长音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1150-2-4", "zh": "munī gacchanti（众牟尼走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1151-2-21", "zh": "166. 阳性中，在 yo 之前的 jha（yosu jhissa pume）[ka.96; rū.148; nī.259]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1152-2-9", "zh": "在阳性中，yo 之前名为 jha 的 i 音可以变为 a（ṭa）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1153-2-4", "zh": "munayo gacchanti（众牟尼走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1154-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“jha 的”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1154-5-8", "zh": "例如 rattiyo（诸夜）、daṇḍino（诸持杖者）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1155-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“阳性中”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1155-5-6", "zh": "例如 aṭṭhīni（诸骨）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1156-2-43", "zh": "bho muni；依“ayunaṃ vā dīgho”规则变为长音：bho munī；bhonto munī、bhonto munayo；muniṃ；munī、munayo；muninā；munīhi、munībhi；munissa、munino；munīnaṃ；munismā、munimhā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1157-2-21", "zh": "167. smā 变为 nā（nā smāssa）[ka.215; rū.41; nī.442]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1158-2-9", "zh": "在 jha、la 之后，smā 可以变为 nā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1159-2-19", "zh": "muninā；munīhi、munībhi；munissa、munino；munīnaṃ；munismiṃ、munimhi；munīsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1160-2-21", "zh": "isi gacchati（仙人走），isī、isayo，bho isi、bho isī，bhonto isī、bhonto isayo，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1161-2-21", "zh": "aggi jalati（火燃烧），aggī、aggayo，bho aggi、bho aggī，bhonto aggī、bhonto aggayo，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1162-2-98", "zh": "同样变化的还有 kucchi、muṭṭhi、gaṇṭhi、maṇi、pati、adhipati、gahapati、senāpati、narapati、yati、ñāti、sāti、vatthi、atithi、sārathi、bondi、ādi、upādi、nidhi、vidhi、odhi、byādhi、samādhi、udadhi、upadhi、nirupadhi、dhani、senāni、kapi、dīpi、kimi、timi、ari、hari、giri、kali、bali、sāli、añjali、kavi、ravi、asi、masi、kesi、pesi、rāsi、ahi、vīhi 等词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1163-2-3", "zh": "下面说特殊的规定。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1164-2-99", "zh": "依大注（mahāvutti），有些名为 jha 的词即使没有变为短音，yo 也变为 no；可以见到以下经文：“cha munino agāramunino, anagāramunino, sekhamunino, asekhamunino, paccekamunino, munimunino”[mahāni.14]，“ñāṇupapannā munino vadanti”，“ekamekāya itthiyā, aṭṭhaṭṭha patino siyuṃ”[jā.2.21.344]，“patino kiramhākaṃ visiṭṭhanārīnaṃ”[vi.van.323]，“haṃsādhipatino ime”[jā.2.21.38]。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1165-2-71", "zh": "在偈颂中，依“ghabrahmāditve”规则，muni 之后的 ga（呼格词尾）也可以变为 e：porohicco tavaṃ mune [apa.thera 1.1.540]，dhammadasso tavaṃ mune [apa.thera 1.1.540]，ciraṃ jīva mahāvīra, kappaṃ tiṭṭha mahāmune [apa.thera 1.2.168]，paṭiggaṇha mahāmune [apa.thera 1.41.83]，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1165-72-84", "zh": "tuyhatthāya mahāmune [apa.thera 1.3.345]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1166-2-54", "zh": "也就是在这些词之后，aṃ 格词尾也可以变为 naṃ：tamāhu ekaṃ muninaṃ carantaṃ [su.ni.210]，muninaṃ monapathesu sikkhamānaṃ [jā.1.8.44]，pitaraṃ puttagiddhinaṃ [jā.2.22.2377]，sabbakāmasamiddhinaṃ [jā.1.13.103]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1167-2-4", "zh": "而在 isi 一词中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1168-2-14", "zh": "168. isi 之后的 si 变为 e（ṭe sissisismā）[根本文本作 ṭe sissasmā]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1169-2-7", "zh": "在 isi 之后，si 可以变为 e（ṭe）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1170-2-20", "zh": "yo no’jja vinaye kaṅkhaṃ, atthadhammavidū ise [jā.2.22.1164]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1170-21-69", "zh": "依“ghabrahmāditve”规则，ga 也可以变为 e：nisīdāhi mahāise [jā.2.20.114]，tvaṃ no’si saraṇaṃ ise [jā.2.22.1326]，putto uppajjataṃ ise [jā.1.14.104]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1171-2-7", "zh": "169. 第二格的 yo（dutiyassa yossa）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1172-2-8", "zh": "在 isi 之后，第二格的 yo 可以变为 e（ṭe）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1173-2-17", "zh": "samaṇe brāhmaṇe vande, sampannacaraṇe ise [jā.1.16.314]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1174-2-13", "zh": "而在复合词中：mahesi gacchati（大仙人走），mahesī gacchanti、mahesayo、mahesino。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1174-14-17", "zh": "在 aṃ 格中，则成立 mahesinaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1174-18-151", "zh": "可以见到以下经文：“saṅgāyiṃsu mahesayo”[vi.va.ganthārambhakathā; pe.va.ganthārambhakathā]，“vānamuttā mahesayo”[abhidhammatthasaṅgaha 第113页]；“na taṃ sammaggatā yaññaṃ, upayanti mahesino, etaṃ sammaggatā yaññaṃ, upayanti mahesino”[saṃ.ni.1.120]，“pahantā mahesino kāme, yena tiṇṇā mahesino”；“mahesiṃ vijitāvinaṃ”[ma.ni.2.459]；“saṅghañcāpi mahesinaṃ, kuñjaraṃva mahesinaṃ, upagantvā mahesinaṃ”[bu.vaṃ.9.1]，“khippaṃ passa mahesinaṃ”[jā.2.19.70]，“katakiccaṃ mahesinaṃ”[jā.2.19.102]。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1175-2-3", "zh": "在 aggi 一词中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1176-2-28", "zh": "170. aggi 之后的 si 变为 ni（sissaggito ni）[ka.95; rū.145; nī.254；多本作“sissāggito ni”]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1177-2-7", "zh": "在 aggi 之后，si 可以变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1178-2-13", "zh": "aggi jalati、aggini jalati（火燃烧），aggī jalanti、aggayo，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1179-2-17", "zh": "不过在圣典中，可以见到 aggi、gini、agginī 三个表示“火”的同义词——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1179-18-102", "zh": "如“rāgaggi, dosaggi, mohaggī”[a.ni.7.46]；“channā kuṭi āhito gini, vivaṭā kuṭi nibbuto gini”[su.ni.19]，“mahāgini sampajjalito”[theragā.702，略有差异]，“yasmā so jāyate ginī”[jā.1.10.58]；“agginiṃ sampajjalitaṃ pavisanti”[su.ni.675]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1179-103-108", "zh": "它们各自有各自的变化表。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1180-2-46", "zh": "在 seṭṭhi、pati、adhipati、senāpati、atithi、sārathi 这些词之后，yo 也变为 no，aṃ 格词尾可以变为 naṃ：seṭṭhino、seṭṭhinaṃ，patino、patinaṃ，adhipatino、adhipatinaṃ，senāpatino、senāpatinaṃ，atithino、atithinaṃ，sārathino、sārathinaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1180-47-53", "zh": "也可以见到 gahapatayo、jānipatayo 等固定不变的形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1181-2-3", "zh": "在 ādi 一词中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1182-2-21", "zh": "依“ratthyādīhi ṭo smiṃno”规则，smiṃ 变为 o（ṭo）：ādismiṃ、ādimhi、ādo、gāthādo、pādādo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1182-22-62", "zh": "至于“ādiṃ、gāthādiṃ、pādādiṃ”等，则是用第二格表示处所义，就像“imaṃ rattiṃ、imaṃ divasaṃ、purimaṃ disaṃ、pacchimaṃ disaṃ、taṃ khaṇaṃ、taṃ layaṃ、taṃ muhuttaṃ”等一样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1183-2-7", "zh": "现在讲复合词中 jha 不作 a（ṭa）替换的情况。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1184-2-8", "zh": "171. 阳性的他义复合词中，在 i 之后（itoññatthe pume）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1185-2-14", "zh": "在阳性的他义复合词（aññapadatthasamāsa，即多财释）中，i 音之后第一格、第二格的 yo 依次可以变为 no、ne。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1185-15-23", "zh": "依规则的拆分（suttavibhatta），在后分义复合词（uttarapadatthasamāsa）中，有时 yo 也变为 no、ne。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-1186-2-3", "zh": "在第一格的 yo 中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1187-2-82", "zh": "micchādiṭṭhino、sammādiṭṭhino、muṭṭhassatino、upaṭṭhitassatino、asāre sāramatino [dha.pa.11]、nimmānaratino devā、ye devā vasavattino [saṃ.ni.1.168]、aṭṭhete cakkavattino、dhamme dhammānuvattino [saṃ.ni.5.34]、saggaṃ sugatino yanti [dha.pa.126]、tomara’ṅkusapāṇino [jā.2.22.223]、daṇḍamuggarapāṇino、ariyavuttino、nipakā santavuttino，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1188-2-3", "zh": "在第二格的 yo 中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1189-2-21", "zh": "muṭṭhassatine、upaṭṭhitassatine、ariyavuttine、tomara’ṅkusapāṇine [jā.2.22.190]，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1190-2-3", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1190-4-11", "zh": "例如 micchādiṭṭhī janā gacchanti（持邪见的人们走），micchādiṭṭhī jane passati（他看见持邪见的人们）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1191-2-23", "zh": "不过，老师们在这里也认可“tomara’ṅkusapāṇayo, atthe visāradamatayo”[ka.253]这样的形式。", "confidence": 65}
